---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const apk = 'https://github.com/srjn45/warden-android-app/releases/latest/download/warden-latest.apk';
---
<section class="section" style="text-align:center">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:6px">📱 Drive your fleet from your phone</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 22px">
      A native Android app for warden — spawn, watch, and talk to agents, plus a
      full terminal and on-screen key bar, over Tailscale or your LAN.
    </p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px">
      <img src={`${base}media/warden-app-hosts.png`} alt="warden Android app — host picker and navigation"
        style="height:460px;max-width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px" loading="lazy" />
      <img src={`${base}media/warden-app-agents.png`} alt="warden Android app — live agent list grouped by directory"
        style="height:460px;max-width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <p>
      <a href={apk} style="background:var(--accent);color:#06210f;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">Download the Android APK</a>
    </p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:10px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">
      Sideloading: Android will ask you to allow installs from your browser the
      first time — that's expected. A Play Store listing is on the way.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
